 role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/careers">Life At Zensar</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/1IYFSaXd3Q6tltaKH4artG/180518cf324d5cf25e12bed8f730a232/career_0000s_0003_Life-at-Zensar.png?w=400&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/1IYFSaXd3Q6tltaKH4artG/180518cf324d5cf25e12bed8f730a232/career_0000s_0003_Life-at-Zensar.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/1IYFSaXd3Q6tltaKH4artG/180518cf324d5cf25e12bed8f730a232/career_0000s_0003_Life-at-Zensar.png?w=900&amp;q=85&amp;fm=webp"/></div><p class="mb-4 text-base font-extralight text-white lg:text-lg">Ready to shape a better future? Join a team that celebrates innovation, growth, and the freedom to explore endless opportunities.</p></div></li><li role="none" class="group/l2 w-full"><a class="block text-lg whitespace-nowrap text-white outline-none hover:underline focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white md:text-sm lg:w-max 2xl:text-2xl" href="/diversity-equity-and-inclusion">Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-[-100%] hidden w-70 flex-col transition-opacity duration-300 lg:flex pointer-events-none opacity-0" style="left:calc(100% + 3rem);top:0"><div class="relative mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg"><img alt="" width="400" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/bjl3f17nyta4/3sQHy